Portions derived from roc-platform-template-zig at revision
d4db636a2f606edf5ae4803f84588f7a5207d53a:
https://github.com/lukewilliamboswell/roc-platform-template-zig/tree/d4db636a2f606edf5ae4803f84588f7a5207d53a

The retained x64musl libc.a test link artifact is byte-identical to the file
at that revision. Its digest and source URL are recorded in
assets/provenance.json.

The generated x64musl rcrt1.o is built from musl sources bundled with Zig
0.16.0, whose distribution digests are pinned in Blueprint.lock. It supplies
self-relocation for static PIE executables. The musl license and contributor
notices are retained in musl-COPYRIGHT.

